flowchart TB
    subgraph mechanical[Proposed mechanical load path — concept only]
        Sony[Sony ZV-E1 and 18–50 mm lens] --> QR[Metal quick release and anti-rotation saddle]
        X6[Insta360 X6] --> Stick[Factory extendable stick]
        Stick --> Clamp[Two clamps on rigid lower tube and brace]
        QR --> Bridge[Removable printed bridge modules]
        Clamp --> Bridge
        Bridge --> Nuts[Metal bolts and correct OEM M6 sliding nuts]
        Nuts --> Rails[A2 factory rails — 213 mm center spacing]
        Rails --> Body[A2 chassis]
    end
    subgraph recording[Initial recording arrangement — proposed]
        SonyBattery[Sony internal battery] --> SonyRecording[Sony internal recording]
        X6Battery[X6 internal battery] --> X6Recording[X6 internal recording]
    end
    subgraph robot[Functional robot reference — simplified from OEM sources]
        Sensors[Native perception sensors — variant dependent] --> Compute[Motion-control and user-development computers]
        Compute --> Motion[Motion-control system]
        Motion --> Legs[Four legs — 3 actuated joints each]
        RobotBatteries[Dual robot batteries] --> Distribution[Robot power distribution]
        Distribution --> Compute
        Distribution --> Motion
    end
